id: genes-of-a-parasite
name: Genes of a Parasite
order: 2
optionOf: neo-tuffle-genes
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver that you spent 3+ Adaptation Points on, reduce their Ki points by x(bT), where x is equal to three times the amount of Adaptation Points you spent.
text: >
  Genes of a Parasite [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver that you spent 3+ Adaptation Points on, reduce their Ki points by x(bT), where x is equal to three times the amount of Adaptation Points you spent.

---

# Asked as an attack with 3+ Adaptation Points spent on its Strike Roll hits - each Opponent it hit loses 3(bT) Ki a point, once a
# Round (chat.mjs parasiteGenesFor).
[passive]
allow neoTuffleGenes.parasite;
